(update_if) and the correction-lifecycle race it closes, atomic
agent-trust EMA updates, budget cap persistence + SQL SUM aggregate,
and thread-safe usage accounting. The connect-time DNS re-validation
and event-loop responsiveness tests live in test_async_hardening.py."""

